WEBVTT

00:12.490 --> 00:14.160
<b>How many have I taken down now?</b>

00:14.700 --> 00:15.830
<b>Child Emperor said...</b>

00:16.700 --> 00:19.250
<b>He planned the attack,
so the enemy forces</b>

00:19.290 --> 00:21.790
<b>would be spread out
as much as possible, but...</b>

00:25.960 --> 00:26.920
<b>Yo!</b>

00:34.510 --> 00:36.390
<b>So you're Zombieman, huh?</b>

00:36.600 --> 00:38.020
<b>Then die already!</b>

00:44.360 --> 00:46.070
<b>Isn't this more than my share?</b>

00:48.150 --> 00:52.660
<b>I specialize in undercover ops, espionage,
and investigating contaminated zones.</b>

00:52.700 --> 00:54.370
<b>Fighting isn't exactly my strong suit.</b>

00:54.530 --> 00:55.740
<b>He's bleeding.</b>

00:55.790 --> 00:57.700
<b>Let's put this half-dead guy
out of his misery!</b>

00:58.290 --> 00:59.120
<b>Bring it on.</b>

01:06.460 --> 01:08.840
<b>Oh boy,
this is bone-breaking work...</b>

01:08.960 --> 01:10.880
<b>...literally.</b>

01:12.970 --> 01:16.600
<b>IMMORTAL BLOODBATH</b>

01:19.020 --> 01:21.190
<b>What's behind these doors?</b>

01:21.980 --> 01:24.730
<b>Whatever it is,
it's definitely not going to be good.</b>

01:29.190 --> 01:31.740
<b>I've been waiting forever, Hero.</b>

01:34.160 --> 01:35.120
<b><i>A bat?</i></b>

01:42.330 --> 01:43.830
<b>THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
VAMPIRE (PUREBRED)</b>

01:43.830 --> 01:46.420
<b>-Kill each other!
-Don't finish it too quick.</b>

01:46.500 --> 01:48.710
<b>Good luck, Mr. Hero!</b>

01:49.170 --> 01:53.470
<b>Looks like they all want you to die.
What did you do to piss them off?</b>

01:54.050 --> 01:57.220
<b>You're all beasts,
so get along already.</b>

01:57.850 --> 01:59.810
<b>They're just trying to annoy me.</b>

02:00.140 --> 02:04.690
<b>It's jealousy. The talentless always
make the same mistake.</b>

02:04.940 --> 02:08.230
<b>They think a few petty tricks will
somehow close the gap between us.</b>

02:08.360 --> 02:11.150
<b>Start the deathmatch show!</b>

02:11.280 --> 02:13.490
<b>I'll have his innards.</b>

02:13.650 --> 02:16.240
<b>A Class-S hero
with high combat power.</b>

02:16.530 --> 02:19.870
<b>A vampire who feeds on monsters
and is hated by everyone.</b>

02:20.540 --> 02:23.160
<b>No matter which one dies,
it's good for us.</b>

02:23.500 --> 02:25.500
<b>A deathmatch between
two powerful fighters.</b>

02:25.540 --> 02:28.380
<b>Whoever survives won't be left
in one piece.</b>

02:28.500 --> 02:31.260
<b>And that's when we'll surround him
and rip him to pieces.</b>

02:31.380 --> 02:33.760
<b>So, you two go ahead and
get things started.</b>

02:33.880 --> 02:36.220
<b>Show us what you got,
both of you!</b>

02:37.600 --> 02:40.930
<b>Just ignore the noise.
I'll take care of them later.</b>

02:41.060 --> 02:43.390
<b>By the way, are you a Class-S hero?</b>

02:43.730 --> 02:46.270
<b>I'm not well-versed in worldly matters.
State your name!</b>

02:46.560 --> 02:48.940
<b>Apologies, I should've told you my name.</b>

02:49.400 --> 02:50.650
<b>Allow me to introduce myself...</b>

02:53.740 --> 02:57.070
<b>Both of them used surprise attacks,
but Vampire landed the first blow.</b>

02:57.200 --> 02:58.240
<b>This is awesome!</b>

02:59.160 --> 03:00.030
<b>This blood...</b>

03:00.160 --> 03:03.500
<b>is the worst I've ever tasted.
No way can I drink this.</b>

03:03.540 --> 03:06.870
<b>Hey, what's going on?
Is it over already, Mr. Hero?</b>

03:06.870 --> 03:09.080
<b>I bet he's the weakest in Class S.</b>

03:09.170 --> 03:12.380
<b>At least wear him down
a little before you die.</b>

03:12.670 --> 03:13.670
<b>-Oh?!
-Oh?!</b>

03:14.630 --> 03:16.430
<b>Hm? He's getting back up.</b>

03:16.470 --> 03:18.340
<b>I guess he wasn't drained
of all his blood?</b>

03:18.390 --> 03:19.260
<b>Nice!</b>

03:25.100 --> 03:28.020
<b>Trying to stand with
the last of your strength...</b>

03:28.150 --> 03:29.310
<b>Pathetic.</b>

03:29.440 --> 03:32.650
<b>But don't expect your unyielding
sense of justice to be rewarded.</b>

03:32.900 --> 03:34.400
<b>I am Vampire.</b>

03:34.400 --> 03:38.570
<b>The only true monster
in the Monster Association.</b>

03:38.610 --> 03:41.740
<b>A vampire with a bloodline carrying
supernatural powers for generations.</b>

03:41.910 --> 03:45.580
<b>Even after a brief fight,
the difference should be clear.</b>

03:49.750 --> 03:50.710
<b>Go to hell.</b>

03:59.010 --> 04:01.100
<b>Catching bullets is nothing special.</b>

04:01.350 --> 04:02.600
<b>Time to return the favor!</b>

04:04.010 --> 04:05.850
<b>That's what you call an easy win.</b>

04:06.560 --> 04:07.850
<b>Applause, please!</b>

04:09.060 --> 04:12.230
<b>No reaction?
You all have no manners!</b>

04:14.230 --> 04:17.190
<b>Huh? How are you still standing?</b>

04:17.530 --> 04:22.240
<b>Those bullets pierced your vital organs
and destroyed your brain.</b>

04:22.490 --> 04:26.370
<b>Before that, I ripped open
your carotid artery with my fangs.</b>

04:26.410 --> 04:28.330
<b>Has the bleeding already stopped?</b>

04:28.870 --> 04:34.130
<b>I've heard of this before.
A hero said to be immortal...</b>

04:34.750 --> 04:36.260
<b>Hmph, I see.</b>

04:36.880 --> 04:39.510
<b>These guys are fake monsters.</b>

04:41.340 --> 04:44.350
<b>And you're a fake human.</b>

04:44.470 --> 04:45.310
<b>Shut up.</b>

04:48.060 --> 04:50.600
<b>But your ability to regenerate...</b>

04:50.730 --> 04:52.520
<b>Is something you can be proud of.</b>

05:12.170 --> 05:14.170
<b>Let's have some more fun.</b>

05:25.510 --> 05:28.600
<b>Even among fakes, you're different
from the rest of the trash.</b>

05:28.770 --> 05:30.850
<b>You're kind of interesting!</b>

05:31.350 --> 05:33.100
<b>Whoa! It snapped.</b>

05:39.150 --> 05:40.780
<b>You slipped up!</b>

05:44.490 --> 05:48.700
<b>Don't think you're the only one
with regenerative powers.</b>

05:53.500 --> 05:57.000
<b>An inferior species that can't do
a thing without weapons.</b>

05:57.290 --> 05:58.590
<b>So don't get cocky!</b>

05:59.460 --> 06:01.550
<b>Even regeneration has its limits.</b>

06:01.720 --> 06:03.430
<b>Time to get torn to shreds!</b>

06:11.810 --> 06:13.890
<b>Whoa, back away from Vampire!</b>

06:14.020 --> 06:15.850
<b>He'll drain you dry
without thinking twice!</b>

06:16.110 --> 06:18.570
<b>I'm almost fully healed
after sucking on all this blood.</b>

06:18.730 --> 06:22.240
<b>Good thing I had a blood supply nearby.</b>

06:22.570 --> 06:26.490
<b>What about you?
You look more like a zombie now?</b>

06:39.090 --> 06:42.880
<b>I don't feel like moving...
but I guess I've got no choice.</b>

06:44.590 --> 06:46.090
<b>Hey, Vampire.</b>

06:46.260 --> 06:49.760
<b>This is going to be a bloodbath.
Brace yourself.</b>

06:50.560 --> 06:53.390
<b>30 MINUTES LATER</b>

06:58.730 --> 07:02.230
<b>I've killed you over and over...</b>

07:03.320 --> 07:06.910
<b>You should definitely be dead...yet...</b>

07:07.200 --> 07:10.410
<b>Yeah, you beat me about 200 times.</b>

07:10.950 --> 07:12.790
<b>Looks like I finally got my first win.</b>

07:13.120 --> 07:15.580
<b>Vampire lost to Zombieman?</b>

07:16.670 --> 07:18.290
<b>He's not moving. He's dead.</b>

07:18.330 --> 07:22.380
<b>There were so many ways to win.
What an idiot.</b>

07:22.750 --> 07:26.930
<b>It's been a while since
I fought such a tough monster.</b>

07:28.680 --> 07:30.350
<b>Oh man, I'm beat.</b>

07:33.060 --> 07:34.310
<b>He said he's tired.</b>

07:34.680 --> 07:36.690
<b>Hey, where do you think you're going?</b>

07:37.020 --> 07:38.850
<b>There's no time to rest.</b>

07:38.980 --> 07:42.610
<b>Next, you're taking on all of us.</b>

07:47.570 --> 07:52.410
<b>So there's about 30 of you?
No way I'd just run off like that.</b>

07:52.620 --> 07:54.370
<b>Huh? Is he for real?</b>

07:55.080 --> 07:56.960
<b>Your reckless fighting style
won't work on us!</b>

07:56.960 --> 08:00.420
<b>Pin him down! Attack him so fast that
he can't regenerate...</b>

07:58.960 --> 08:04.170
<b>PUNCH     DRAG     SCREAM</b>

08:00.540 --> 08:02.500
<b>-H-Hey, you go!
-No, you go...</b>

08:10.430 --> 08:14.560
<b>With these wounds, it'll probably
take a few minutes to fully heal.</b>

08:20.150 --> 08:21.900
<b>Time to take a break...</b>

08:22.560 --> 08:24.150
<b>I just wanna get this over with.</b>

08:24.480 --> 08:27.950
<b>I don't mind the blood...
but I hate sweating.</b>

08:28.990 --> 08:30.280
<b><i>This is Child Emperor.</i></b>

08:30.410 --> 08:32.950
<b><i>I've secured Waganma and</i>
<i>we're heading to the surface.</i></b>

08:33.330 --> 08:35.830
<b><i>Everyone, lure the enemy away,</i>
<i>as planned.</i></b>

08:36.450 --> 08:39.750
<b><i>Don't be overeager in pursuing them.</i>
<i>The enemy is dangerous...</i></b>

08:41.290 --> 08:42.500
<b>This is Zombieman.</b>

08:43.250 --> 08:46.050
<b>Thanks. We couldn't
have done it without you.</b>

08:46.460 --> 08:48.130
<b>Let me thank you
on everyone's behalf.</b>

08:49.760 --> 08:51.180
<b>He's doing a good job.</b>

08:52.680 --> 08:53.890
<b>Good, I'm all healed.</b>

08:56.100 --> 08:58.140
<b>Time to go kick some more butt.</b>

08:59.640 --> 09:01.100
<b>Finally, I've been waiting.</b>

09:01.100 --> 09:03.650
<b>Looks like this one's gonna
be a real feast!</b>

09:03.770 --> 09:07.280
<b>All of you are nothing
but food for Big-Eater.</b>

09:07.820 --> 09:11.950
<b>I'm the monster with an endless appetite
that devours everything!</b>

09:12.410 --> 09:16.620
<b>I'll swallow all the heroes whole!</b>

09:19.120 --> 09:21.370
<b>That sounds like quite a fight.</b>

09:21.870 --> 09:23.920
<b>But if it's a Class-S hero,
they should be fine.</b>

09:24.590 --> 09:26.920
<b>We need to focus on our own battles.</b>

09:27.670 --> 09:30.170
<b>Master gave us permission
to go off on our own.</b>

09:30.760 --> 09:32.010
<b>We must not let him down.</b>

09:42.600 --> 09:45.770
<b>They're a private rescue squad
deployed by Mr. Narinki.</b>

09:46.440 --> 09:48.110
<b>Looks like they've been brainwashed.</b>

09:48.480 --> 09:50.190
<b>We'll subdue them without hurting them.</b>

09:50.190 --> 09:51.280
<b>Okay!</b>

09:51.400 --> 09:52.530
<b>Understood.</b>

09:54.910 --> 09:58.660
<b>Here's another bunch of clueless fools
that I can mold to my liking.</b>

09:59.750 --> 10:03.080
<b>Come on you guys,
now's the time to serve me.</b>

10:11.340 --> 10:12.920
<b>How to deal with guns?</b>

10:13.680 --> 10:17.640
<b>Come on, that bullet's even slower
than my sword.</b>

10:20.020 --> 10:21.350
<b>I can go faster.</b>

10:27.110 --> 10:28.400
<b>First, destroy their weapons.</b>

10:28.860 --> 10:32.360
<b>Next, disable their battle suits.
Aim for their elbows and knee joints.</b>

10:32.490 --> 10:33.320
<b>Roger that!</b>

10:42.370 --> 10:44.040
<b>Not as easy as I hoped...</b>

10:44.250 --> 10:46.080
<b>Come on! Go! Go!</b>

10:46.210 --> 10:48.500
<b>Welcome your new comrades!</b>

10:48.880 --> 10:51.880
<b>That monster is
messing with their minds.</b>

10:53.720 --> 10:55.630
<b>Snap out of it!</b>

10:57.800 --> 10:59.720
<b>It's no use trying to persuade them.</b>

11:03.020 --> 11:04.940
<b>Such tremendous strength.</b>

11:05.520 --> 11:06.520
<b>However...</b>

11:10.400 --> 11:13.940
<b>A blade without will is
nothing to be feared!</b>

11:17.110 --> 11:19.450
<b>They're strong enough to be a problem...</b>

11:20.080 --> 11:22.540
<b>How should we deal with this now?</b>

11:22.790 --> 11:26.920
<b>If I attack them from beyond their reach,
they should be helpless.</b>

11:27.370 --> 11:28.250
<b>Right?</b>

11:31.960 --> 11:32.840
<b>Right.</b>

11:35.220 --> 11:37.550
<b>Those are unauthorized
battle suits obtained illegally.</b>

11:37.930 --> 11:39.550
<b>They've got solid martial arts skills.</b>

11:39.720 --> 11:42.350
<b>Keep dodging and
throw off their rhythm!</b>

11:43.720 --> 11:45.310
<b>How cute,
you have so many openings.</b>

11:45.600 --> 11:49.310
<b>Now I will seize
my first new love slave!</b>

11:52.070 --> 11:53.020
<b>With his bare hand?</b>

11:54.070 --> 11:55.280
<b>What the—? Who is it...?!</b>

11:55.940 --> 11:57.150
<b>Amai Mask!!</b>

11:57.900 --> 12:00.450
<b>She's using this whip to
control her underlings.</b>

12:01.370 --> 12:03.290
<b>Probably some kind of
pain-induced hypnosis...</b>

12:04.080 --> 12:06.250
<b>If you get struck by it,
you might lose your willpower.</b>

12:07.250 --> 12:08.790
<b>You guys are at a disadvantage here.</b>

12:09.210 --> 12:10.960
<b>Leave this to me and
fight somewhere else.</b>

12:12.210 --> 12:16.590
<b>I won't get into details,
but I have a simple solution.</b>

12:17.720 --> 12:19.010
<b>Not to worry.</b>

12:19.340 --> 12:21.340
<b>I'm not so weak
as to be brainwashed.</b>

12:21.600 --> 12:23.720
<b>For now, let's trust the superstar.</b>

12:25.930 --> 12:28.230
<b>All right... We're counting on you.</b>

12:31.610 --> 12:32.810
<b>Oh my...</b>

12:33.360 --> 12:36.400
<b>Staying behind alone in this situation?
Are you out of your mind?</b>

12:36.900 --> 12:40.070
<b>Heroes who think like that
are only a burden.</b>

12:40.780 --> 12:44.080
<b>Just as I thought, you're gorgeous.</b>

12:44.790 --> 12:46.240
<b>I'm so happy we met.</b>

12:46.910 --> 12:50.710
<b>Just between you and me...
I've actually been a fan of yours.</b>

12:51.370 --> 12:52.920
<b>So how about it?</b>

12:53.040 --> 12:55.300
<b>Want to sneak off somewhere
and get nice and cozy?</b>

13:00.970 --> 13:04.680
<b>Then just maybe I'll free
them from my control.</b>

13:05.220 --> 13:08.480
<b>Do you really think
I'd agree to such a deal?</b>

13:08.520 --> 13:10.350
<b>You wretched monster!</b>

13:10.600 --> 13:12.060
<b>Brace yourself!</b>

13:13.150 --> 13:15.730
<b>That's mean, Amai Mask.</b>

13:16.400 --> 13:18.360
<b>I'm gonna make you mine,
no matter what.</b>

13:20.150 --> 13:21.400
<b>Something feels off...</b>

13:21.860 --> 13:24.240
<b>What kind of solution
is he talking about?</b>

13:24.530 --> 13:25.660
<b>I don't know.</b>

13:25.780 --> 13:27.240
<b>But he seemed super confident.</b>

13:27.370 --> 13:29.960
<b>He must have a trump card
he doesn't want to show anyone.</b>

13:30.210 --> 13:33.460
<b>He might break the brainwashing by
whipping out a mic</b>

13:33.460 --> 13:35.460
<b>and doing a little musical number.</b>

13:35.790 --> 13:38.170
<b>You expect way too much from idols.</b>

13:39.090 --> 13:40.760
<b><i>To be a hero...</i></b>

13:41.010 --> 13:43.180
<b><i>To be a champion of justice...</i></b>

13:43.840 --> 13:45.510
<b><i>evil must be struck down.</i></b>

13:47.810 --> 13:49.140
<b>Without any hesitation...</b>

13:49.270 --> 13:51.480
<b>Are you really that Amai Mask?</b>

13:52.480 --> 13:53.440
<b>Damn it!</b>

13:56.110 --> 13:58.110
<b>My whip’s useless?!</b>

13:58.230 --> 14:00.650
<b>W-Wait! I surrender!</b>

14:03.280 --> 14:06.030
<b>I am at your command.
Master Amai Mask.</b>

14:09.870 --> 14:11.660
<b>Y-You're not human...!</b>

14:11.910 --> 14:14.210
<b>Monsters must die.</b>

14:16.670 --> 14:18.210
<b>What's that sound?</b>

14:18.840 --> 14:20.170
<b>Th-That's...a monster?!</b>

14:20.300 --> 14:22.760
<b>No, maybe Pig God?</b>

14:23.340 --> 14:24.590
<b>What's going on with that?</b>

14:24.720 --> 14:26.260
<b>How does he digest all that?</b>

14:26.720 --> 14:27.760
<b>No idea.</b>

14:28.010 --> 14:30.770
<b>But it feels like
we've seen something we shouldn't have.</b>

14:31.520 --> 14:34.310
<b>Yeah... Let's go a different way...</b>

14:35.400 --> 14:36.610
<b>There's something down below!</b>

14:47.490 --> 14:49.700
<b>Like a moth to a flame.</b>

14:50.240 --> 14:53.120
<b>Heroes of justice diving in
and getting tangled in my hair.</b>

14:52.370 --> 14:53.910
<b>THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
MALONG HAIR</b>

14:54.330 --> 14:55.290
<b>A monster...</b>

14:55.670 --> 14:59.380
<b><i>He's so hot.</i>
<i>He's seducing me.</i></b>

14:59.920 --> 15:00.750
<b><i>But I cannot.</i></b>

15:01.130 --> 15:03.090
<b><i>He's a monster and I'm a hero.</i></b>

15:03.420 --> 15:05.470
<b><i>It's forbidden love.</i></b>

15:06.010 --> 15:08.800
<b>Hey, the enemy's ability is unknown.</b>

15:09.470 --> 15:11.220
<b>Test him with your Flying Sword.</b>

15:12.310 --> 15:14.520
<b>This fool's falling for a monster again.</b>

15:14.810 --> 15:16.480
<b>Snap out of it, you idiot.</b>

15:16.770 --> 15:18.150
<b>Who are you calling an idiot?</b>

15:18.520 --> 15:20.940
<b>Oh, I get it. You're jealous.</b>

15:21.070 --> 15:22.110
<b>Huh? Can I cut you?</b>

15:22.230 --> 15:23.530
<b>No. Calm down!</b>

15:23.740 --> 15:25.320
<b>This is no time to be fooling around.</b>

15:25.320 --> 15:27.910
<b>Even while we stand here,
battles are raging everywhere.</b>

15:30.580 --> 15:34.830
<b>It's our duty to ease the burden
on Master and the others.</b>

15:35.160 --> 15:38.670
<b>All right. He's a hottie,
but so be it.</b>

15:39.130 --> 15:40.380
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

15:40.710 --> 15:44.340
<b>But I can't reciprocate your feelings.</b>

15:44.460 --> 15:46.930
<b>That came out of nowhere.
I just got dumped.</b>

15:48.010 --> 15:49.090
<b>Flying Sword.</b>

15:53.850 --> 15:57.640
<b><i>Slicing through the air</i>
<i>creates giant whirlwinds.</i></b>

15:57.940 --> 16:00.230
<b><i>I hate to admit it,</i>
<i>but it's a technique I cannot imitate.</i></b>

16:00.520 --> 16:02.860
<b>A frog in a well knows nothing
of the great ocean.</b>

16:03.360 --> 16:06.190
<b>Class-A heroes know nothing
of the terrors of my hair.</b>

16:07.400 --> 16:10.240
<b><i>Impossible! He blocked</i>
<i>Flying Sword with his long hair.</i></b>

16:10.490 --> 16:12.200
<b><i>And what he said wasn't even clever!</i></b>

16:14.870 --> 16:16.580
<b>Hey! Behind you! Underground!</b>

16:21.960 --> 16:23.840
<b>Th-Thanks.</b>

16:24.920 --> 16:25.880
<b>What a pain.</b>

16:26.300 --> 16:28.010
<b>The enemy's weapon is his hair.</b>

16:28.430 --> 16:29.930
<b>Since they're thinner than blades</b>

16:29.930 --> 16:32.050
<b>they slip easily through the gaps
in bones and armor.</b>

16:32.470 --> 16:34.220
<b>Don't overlook even a single strand.</b>

16:34.810 --> 16:37.560
<b>His attack methods likely include
more than just piercing.</b>

16:37.680 --> 16:41.020
<b>He can probably bind, constrict,
throw, or slice with his hair.</b>

16:42.940 --> 16:44.440
<b>Like salt on fresh greens</b>

16:44.440 --> 16:46.320
<b>my long hair will drain
the life out of you.</b>

16:53.320 --> 16:54.490
<b>Don't use your eyes!</b>

16:56.200 --> 16:59.330
<b>Use your reflexes to counter
the hair's killing intent.</b>

16:59.410 --> 17:01.080
<b>Like water on a burnt stone...</b>

17:01.080 --> 17:02.750
<b>Fighting long hair with swords is futile.</b>

17:03.880 --> 17:05.710
<b>Letting anything through
will get us killed.</b>

17:05.710 --> 17:06.840
<b>Intercept every attack.</b>

17:06.960 --> 17:09.260
<b>The human head has over
a hundred thousand hairs.</b>

17:09.590 --> 17:11.180
<b>Yet we only have three swords.</b>

17:11.300 --> 17:12.680
<b>This is gonna wear on our nerves.</b>

17:12.800 --> 17:13.800
<b>Here he comes!</b>

17:18.640 --> 17:19.850
<b>Damn it, I'm tangled up.</b>

17:19.930 --> 17:21.730
<b>Like a candle in the wind...</b>

17:21.850 --> 17:23.440
<b>Your lives are about to go out.</b>

17:23.980 --> 17:26.270
<b>Hmph. He has the worst lines.</b>

17:26.730 --> 17:29.360
<b>Don't worry.
As long as he comes into range</b>

17:29.400 --> 17:31.450
<b>I can break his defense
and cut him clean in half.</b>

17:31.450 --> 17:33.240
<b>One hundred thousand?
Bring it on!</b>

17:33.360 --> 17:35.620
<b>I'll slice and shred every last one!</b>

17:45.790 --> 17:48.420
<b><i>What would Master do</i>
<i>at a time like this...?</i></b>

17:49.960 --> 17:54.510
<b><i>What's your take on</i>
<i>Shibabawa's Earthdoom prophecy?</i></b>

17:55.220 --> 17:58.770
<b><i>Hm? I suspect it's not the end yet.</i></b>

17:59.220 --> 18:01.230
<b><i>Something has been bothering me</i>
<i>this whole time.</i></b>

18:01.850 --> 18:03.980
<b><i>What if,</i>
<i>within this Monster Association</i></b>

18:04.560 --> 18:06.820
<b><i>there exists an unbelievably</i>
<i>dangerous being...</i></b>

18:07.860 --> 18:10.940
<b><i>A monster that</i>
<i>no human could ever defeat</i></b>

18:10.990 --> 18:13.570
<b><i>a being that embodies despair itself.</i></b>

18:14.820 --> 18:16.780
<b><i>What would you do, Master?</i></b>

18:23.330 --> 18:25.960
<b><i>Then I'd have to surpass being human.</i></b>

18:26.630 --> 18:28.500
<b><i>That's what Master said, but...</i></b>

18:28.750 --> 18:31.170
<b><i>But Class-S heroes like Master,</i>
<i>Tornado and Pig God</i></b>

18:31.300 --> 18:33.510
<b><i>have already gone beyond human limits.</i></b>

18:34.010 --> 18:37.300
<b><i>We still have a ways to go,</i>
<i>but at least</i></b>

18:37.550 --> 18:39.220
<b><i>we'll cling on and</i>
<i>keep pushing forward.</i></b>

18:48.230 --> 18:50.070
<b>My Achilles' heel is....</b>

18:51.030 --> 18:52.740
<b>My hair.</b>

18:55.820 --> 18:57.410
<b>We...won?</b>

18:57.910 --> 19:01.580
<b>All we did was keep hacking at
the hair that was attacking us.</b>

19:02.040 --> 19:04.620
<b>Oh man...
He was a terrifying opponent</b>

19:04.750 --> 19:07.580
<b>with his relentless attacks
and incredible reach.</b>

19:09.670 --> 19:11.750
<b>It took all three of us
to bring him down.</b>

19:12.210 --> 19:14.470
<b>Are there more like him?</b>

19:15.300 --> 19:18.180
<b>The remaining monsters are
gonna be pretty tough as well.</b>

19:18.510 --> 19:21.010
<b>Yeah. There's no time to rest.</b>

19:21.390 --> 19:23.770
<b>Although I'm sure Master
isn't having any problems.</b>

19:36.990 --> 19:40.240
<b>Luring them in and slashing them
all down with a single swing.</b>

19:40.370 --> 19:43.330
<b>You are indeed a great swordsman,
Atomic Samurai.</b>

19:44.500 --> 19:47.000
<b>Did someone escape my blade?</b>

19:47.460 --> 19:50.080
<b>I offered my soul to my blade
and became</b>

19:50.210 --> 19:52.170
<b>the Sword Demon Chopper-Upper.</b>

19:52.380 --> 19:55.090
<b>I will feast on your blood
and charge forward</b>

19:55.090 --> 19:56.970
<b>on the path to unrivaled supremacy!</b>

20:00.350 --> 20:01.390
<b>We're even...</b>

20:01.640 --> 20:02.680
<b>Even...</b>

20:03.310 --> 20:04.270
<b>All right then.</b>

20:04.390 --> 20:08.390
<b>Is this everyone? Raise your hand
if you didn't get slashed.</b>

20:10.520 --> 20:11.980
<b>I am Machine God G5.</b>

20:12.440 --> 20:15.440
<b>I have obtained your combat data.</b>

20:15.940 --> 20:19.320
<b>I have completely copied
your sword skills.</b>

20:19.820 --> 20:23.450
<b>Stop your futile resistance
and offer up your neck.</b>

20:24.200 --> 20:25.120
<b>Tsk.</b>

20:30.790 --> 20:31.750
<b>I'm surprised.</b>

20:32.170 --> 20:37.130
<b>Toys these days are so well-made.
I should order one online.</b>

20:37.550 --> 20:39.340
<b>Your bravado won't last.</b>

20:40.090 --> 20:42.720
<b>I will gradually increase
my attack speed.</b>

20:42.930 --> 20:44.600
<b>You're making me yawn.</b>

20:45.180 --> 20:47.230
<b>Crank up your performance.</b>

20:47.430 --> 20:50.690
<b>I thought my disciples could
at least practice on you, but...</b>

20:51.350 --> 20:53.230
<b>You are mistaken.</b>

20:53.650 --> 20:56.610
<b>My true strength isn't just
about copying your techniques</b>

20:56.730 --> 20:57.900
<b>it's upgrading them.</b>

20:58.280 --> 21:00.820
<b>As a robot, I can create
unknown sword techniques</b>

21:00.820 --> 21:03.950
<b>that defy the limitations
of human joint mobility.</b>

21:04.490 --> 21:07.950
<b>Virtual combat calculations complete.
Maximum speed!</b>

21:10.540 --> 21:12.500
<b>Atomic Slash Two-Blade Style.</b>

21:18.090 --> 21:19.970
<b>Nothing but a cheap knockoff, huh?</b>

21:25.260 --> 21:28.600
<b><i>There's something especially hard</i>
<i>embedded in the core.</i></b>

21:28.810 --> 21:30.600
<b><i>There were parts</i>
<i>I couldn't slice through.</i></b>

21:32.560 --> 21:34.310
<b>A weasel's last gasp, huh?</b>

21:34.440 --> 21:36.150
<b>You just don't know when to quit.</b>

21:38.780 --> 21:40.450
<b>Damn it. He got away.</b>

21:41.030 --> 21:42.910
<b>I'll have the surface team
take care of it.</b>

21:42.990 --> 21:44.990
<b>They're quite skilled too.</b>

21:45.700 --> 21:50.040
<b>In fact, their impromptu teamwork
may even be better than ours...</b>

21:50.330 --> 21:52.620
<b>Help! Help!</b>

21:53.000 --> 21:55.040
<b>Help! Someone help me!</b>

21:55.710 --> 21:56.670
<b>Stop!</b>

21:57.250 --> 22:04.260
<b>STOMP STOMP</b>

21:57.800 --> 21:59.800
<b>Hey, kid. Hey, stop.</b>

22:00.590 --> 22:03.470
<b>I'm not gonna do anything to you.
I'm just gonna kill you.</b>

22:03.970 --> 22:05.800
<b>I'll make it fast.
It'll be over in a flash.</b>

22:12.940 --> 22:15.440
<b>Well, well... You've got moves.</b>

22:16.900 --> 22:20.030
<b>Are you trying to pick a fight with me?</b>

23:55.960 --> 24:00.960
<b>TOP DRAGONS</b>
